{"4957410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Universal Flight Simulator 3 PvP", "steam_appid": 4957410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buckle up and get ready for the most realistic and breathtaking flight experience of your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Universal Flight Simulator 3 PvP lets you take the controls of legendary vintage aircraft, cutting-edge jets, and powerful modern helicopters — each with its own unique feel and challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 12 stunning locations across the world, from sun-drenched coastlines to stormy mountain ranges, each meticulously crafted to push your piloting skills to the limit. Master 5 incredible fixed-wing aircraft and 2 agile helicopters, each faithfully recreated with authentic aerodynamics and handling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this time, you're not flying alone. Challenge a friend in local 2-player PvP multiplayer — race head-to-head on circuits, dominate free-flight challenges, and settle once and for all who the ultimate pilot really is. Set the best lap times, unlock new missions, and leave your rival in your wake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Optimized aerodynamic and hydrodynamic simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Physics-based engine simulation with realistic propeller and transmission systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Custom wheels and suspension for ground handling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fully interactive 2D/3D gauges and control panels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Immersive virtual cockpit system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-12 unique locations to discover and master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-5 planes and 2 helicopters, each with distinct flight characteristics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Free flight and circuit racing modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Local 2-player PvP — face off against a friend on the same screen</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buckle up and get ready for the most realistic and breathtaking flight experience of your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Universal Flight Simulator 3 PvP lets you take the controls of legendary vintage aircraft, cutting-edge jets, and powerful modern helicopters — each with its own unique feel and challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 12 stunning locations across the world, from sun-drenched coastlines to stormy mountain ranges, each meticulously crafted to push your piloting skills to the limit. Master 5 incredible fixed-wing aircraft and 2 agile helicopters, each faithfully recreated with authentic aerodynamics and handling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this time, you're not flying alone. Challenge a friend in local 2-player PvP multiplayer — race head-to-head on circuits, dominate free-flight challenges, and settle once and for all who the ultimate pilot really is. Set the best lap times, unlock new missions, and leave your rival in your wake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Optimized aerodynamic and hydrodynamic simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Physics-based engine simulation with realistic propeller and transmission systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Custom wheels and suspension for ground handling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fully interactive 2D/3D gauges and control panels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Immersive virtual cockpit system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-12 unique locations to discover and master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-5 planes and 2 helicopters, each with distinct flight characteristics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Free flight and circuit racing modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Local 2-player PvP — face off against a friend on the same screen</p>", "short_description": "The sky is no longer the limit — it's the battlefield.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstati